# `provenance.toml` is NOT here, and neither are the figures. The record is the
# evidence this project is about, and an artifact nobody committed is one
# nobody can check — so both are committed, exactly as in a real project.
#
# `dvc.lock` and `dvc.yaml` are committed too. Calkit generates them, but they
# are how a collaborator gets the same pipeline state; only edit `calkit.yaml`.
/.venv/
